# Baseline handles: exact duplicates, including reordered conditions.
SUBJECT admin, analyst, auditor
RESOURCE reports SUPPORTS READ, WRITE
RESOURCE audit_log SUPPORTS READ

ALLOW admin ACCESS reports
ALLOW analyst READ reports WHEN authenticated AND on_vpn
ALLOW analyst READ reports WHEN on_vpn AND authenticated
ALLOW auditor READ audit_log
ALLOW auditor READ audit_log
ALLOW admin READ audit_log WHEN mfa
